          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">3. How We Chose These Vests</h2>
<p>
            We have not tested these vests, and nothing here should be read as if we had. The picks
            were made from manufacturer product pages, size charts, warranty terms and independent
            hands-on reviews from two large strength-and-fitness review sites, checked on 15
